.el .ds Aq '
.TH context 1  "context " 
.SH NAME
context \- Porcelain: Retrieve point\-to\-point context surrounding root elements
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcontext\fR [\fB\-\-direction\fR] [\fB\-\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-categorize\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIROOTS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Porcelain: Retrieve point\-to\-point context surrounding root elements
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-direction\fR \fI<DIRECTION>\fR [default: upstream]
Traversal direction (upstream, downstream, both)
.TP
\fB\-\-depth\fR \fI<DEPTH>\fR
Maximum depth of relationship hops
.TP
\fB\-\-categorize\fR
Group context elements by ontology category
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIROOTS\fR]
Root element references (UUIDs, 8\-hex prefixes, or @handles)
